17
00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.840
Okay, our first story,

18
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.720
a few weeks back KTVT in Dallas

19
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.493
reported that a 14 year old, Anika --,

20
00:00:42.378 --> 00:00:46.390
won a $25,000 prize for developing

21
00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.818
