24
00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.388 line:15%
At 14!

25
00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:04.040 line:15%
Anika, oh my gosh, wow.

26
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.039 line:15%
When I was 14 I was trying to beat Sonic the Hedgehog.

27
00:01:07.039 --> 00:01:09.330 line:15%
This is next level,

28
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.660
I mean, this is what we need.

29
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.550
Ah, that gives me like hope

30
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.530
