31
00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:17.800
She's gonna save us all.

32
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.600
Paul, what's your story?

33
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.320
Drew, did you know that there is a town

34
00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.373
