35
00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.040
That's right.
What?

36
00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.070
Yes, this town has a French bulldog as a mayor.

37
00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.350 line:15%
And I got to read you some of the stats here.

38
00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:37.000 line:15%
Over 44,000 people voted for this mayor,

39
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.160 line:15%
and you may think he ran on a platform

40
00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.610 line:15%
of give me liberty or give me milk bones,

41
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.100 line:15%
but he actually ran on a platform

42
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.084 line:15%
of mental health and breast cancer awareness.

43
00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:51.420 line:15%
So this dog is doing a lot of good work.

44
00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.830 line:15%
He knocked out Brenneth Paltrow

45
00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:57.070 line:15%
which was the dog that was in beforehand.

46
00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:59.110 line:15%
And what's actually really amazing about this

47
00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:02.290
