70
00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.910
It doesn't look like a bow tie at all.

71
00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.110
Drew, I'm impressed with your Turkey.

72
00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:10.110
You have a lot more props than I have.

73
00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.510
You're not gonna,

74
00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.090
my turkey is sad.

75
00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:14.510
Okay, Paul, I'm so sorry.

76
00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.410
Did you have another story?

77
00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.490
You know, this has been,

78
00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:20.840
