84
00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.300
It'll teach you how to do Photoshop,

85
00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.133
it will teach you

86
00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:37.510 line:15%
how to go out in the street and take pictures,

87
00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:38.543 line:15%
and for me,

88
00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:40.500 line:15%
since we haven't been able

89
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.680 line:15%
to get out of the house that much,

90
00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.280 line:15%
