97
00:03:56.130 --> 00:04:01.130
Well, I don't know what this is, Paul, but--

98
00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.380
I love it.

99
00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.720
Yours, I look at it and I'm like, oh, it's a turkey.

100
00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:08.294
This I look at and I'm like, "What the heck is that?"

101
00:04:08.294 --> 00:04:10.300
Did we just fail kindergarten, Drew?

102
00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:11.690
