105
00:04:15.852 --> 00:04:17.920
And you know what?

106
00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:18.753
I'm still here.

107
00:04:18.753 --> 00:04:21.350
So, Paul Scheer, everyone.

108
00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.230
Your documentary, by the way, "Marvel 616".

109
00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.270
Yeah, I have a documentary.

110
